## What happens after you contact us

1. We will acknowledge your enquiry within 1–2 business days
2. We will confirm which materials or conversation format best suit your needs
3. Where a scoping call is appropriate, we will propose times within 5 business days
4. Requested documentation will be provided under an appropriate information-sharing arrangement

We do not add contacts to mailing lists without permission. Enquiries are treated as confidential.
